  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.76,
      384.72,
      286.54,
      456.88
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land which is required for a public purpose:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      4.980000019073486,
      7.980000019073486,
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.76,
      457.33,
      226.25,
      553.48
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land to be acquired: Preliminary plan : Ya 2770 Situation Village : Allarai GN Division : Kovilkudiyiruppu, J/301 DS Division : Chavakachcheri District : Jaffna Province : Northern",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.0,
      7.980000019073486,
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.76,
      554.05,
      286.51,
      622.68
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot No. 1 \u2014 Name of the Land: Uluthampulakadu; Description: Garden contains forty three permanent buildings, Five masonry wells and a water tank, Name of the Claimant: Jhon Devekumar willson, 1713/B, Model farm Road, Borella, Colombo 08; Extent: 9.9520 Hectares.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.14,
      333.37,
      539.57,
      470.95
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/ lands on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat, Chavakachcheri on the 28th Wednesday of January 2015 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 14th Wednesday of January, 2015 the nature of their interest in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land, amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
